# Implementation Plan - High-Speed AI SQL Agent Backend Refactor

Refactor the existing AI SQL Agent backend for maximum speed (sub-second target for natural language to SQL generation) without altering the existing folder/file project structure.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Zero Structural Changes**: The directory layout (`app/agent`, `app/retriever`, `app/embedding`, `app/prompt`, `app/validator`, `app/database`, `app/api`, `app/static`) will remain unchanged.
> - **Strict 8-Table Database Scope**: Queries and schema index are restricted exclusively to: `users`, `wallet_transaction`, `sku_inventories`, `companies`, `machine_details`, `withdrawal_request`, `automatic_transactions`, `automate`.
> - **Local Ollama Qwen Optimization**: Tuning Ollama parameters (`temperature=0`, `top_p=0.8`, `do_sample=False`, `num_predict=200`, `stop=[";"]`) to generate minimal SQL output instantly without markdown commentary.

