#### [MODIFY] [sql_optimizer.py](file:///c:/Users/nayak_o7hopi6/Desktop/Agent/app/validator/sql_optimizer.py)
- Perform AST rewriting:
  - Replace `SELECT *` with explicit required columns.
  - Remove unnecessary `ORDER BY` clauses if not explicitly requested.
  - Inject `LIMIT 100` by default on unaggregated queries without limits.
  - Convert `DATE(column) = 'YYYY-MM-DD'` or `YEAR/MONTH` functions to index-friendly sargable date ranges (`column >= 'YYYY-MM-DD 00:00:00' AND column < 'YYYY-MM-DD 23:59:59'`).

